@startuml ai-coach-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (ai-coach-service) - FR-16\nOwner: Mostafa Khamis Abozead
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface ICoach <<provided>> {
  +getAdvice(studentId): Advice
  +getRecoveryStrategies(goalId): List<Strategy>
  +getMotivation(studentId): String
}

class AICoachService <<component>> {
  -goal: IGoal
  -habit: IHabit
  -analytics: IAnalytics
  -aiProvider: IAIProvider
  -repository: IAdviceRepository
  -coachContextBuilder: CoachContextBuilder
  --
  +getAdvice(...) / getRecoveryStrategies(...)
  +getMotivation(...)
}

ICoach <|.. AICoachService
class CoachContextBuilder <<component>> {
  +build(studentId): String
}
AICoachService --> CoachContextBuilder

interface IGoal <<required - Academic service>> {
  +createGoal(studentId, data): Goal
  +updateGoal(goalId, data): Goal
  +completeGoal(goalId): void
  +archiveGoal(goalId): void
  +restoreGoal(goalId): void
  +deleteGoal(goalId): void
  +getGoals(studentId, status): List<Goal>
}

AICoachService --> IGoal
interface IHabit <<required - Habit service>> {
  +createHabit(studentId, data): Habit
  +markDone(habitId, date): void
  +getStreak(habitId): int
  +linkToGoal(habitId, goalId): void
  +getHabits(studentId): List<Habit>
}

AICoachService --> IHabit
interface IAnalytics <<required - Analytics service>> {
  +getGoalWorkload(goalId): Workload
  +isOverloaded(goalId): boolean
  +getStudentWorkloads(studentId): List<Workload>
}

AICoachService --> IAnalytics
interface IAIProvider <<required - AI provider>> {
  +generate(prompt): AIResponse
}

AICoachService --> IAIProvider
interface IAdviceRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Advice): void
  +findById(id): Advice
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Advice>
}

AICoachService --> IAdviceRepository
class Advice {
  -adviceId: String
  -studentId: String
  -text: String
  -createdAt: Date
}
class Strategy {
  -goalId: String
  -text: String
}
IAdviceRepository --> Advice
note bottom of AICoachService
SOLID applied:
S - AICoachService only coordinates; CoachContextBuilder each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing AICoachService.
L - AICoachService can replace any other ICoach implementation.
I - ICoach has only the operations its clients use.
D - AICoachService depends on interfaces (IGoal, IHabit, IAnalytics, IAIProvider, IAdviceRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
